k rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c6zxjx01vyleo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The share price dropped wiped hundreds of billions of dollars from the value of Nvidia.</summary></entry><entry><title>Who is the suspected Chinese spy at centre of the Nvidia investigation?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c80404zyr53wo#0</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:52Z</updated><published>2026-11-09T14:50:35Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c80404zyr53wo--73882470a9b3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/videos/c80404zyr53wo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Alice Huang, a Chinese businesswoman, had a close relationship with Nvidia boss Jensen Huang, reports say.</summary></entry><entry><title>Government 'looking seriously' at banning under-16s from Vinted and eBay</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmzxjvpqrjxro#0</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:52Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T15:37:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmzxjvpqrjxro--1fd2c4b355c2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmzxjvpqrjxro?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">The culture secretary confirms reports they could be in the list of platforms set to be banned next March.</summary></entry><entry><title>Can the Zelda remake capture the magic of the original?</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm8xznl0n1q4o#0</id><updated>2026-11-10T07:31:52Z</updated><published>2026-11-08T00:37:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm8xznl0n1q4o--e3d6f99e0ff0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cm8xznl0n1q4o?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Nintendo has released its remake of what is considered one of the 